%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
  participant UI as Youth Account Dashboard UI
  participant API as Youth Account Management API
  participant AccountSvc as Account Service
  participant TxnSvc as Transaction Service
  participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
  participant DB as Youth Account Settings DB

  == Dashboard Retrieval ==
  Parent->>UI: Login & access dashboard
  UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2, RBAC)
  API->>AccountSvc: Fetch account data
  API->>DB: Read spending limits
  API->>TxnSvc: Fetch recent transactions
  API-->>UI: Dashboard data (balance, limits, transactions)
  UI-->>Parent: Display dashboard
  Note right of API: Audit log: dashboard access

  == Fund Transfer ==
  Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
  UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer (OAuth2, RBAC)
  API->>PaymentSvc: Execute transfer
  PaymentSvc-->>API: Transfer result
  API->>AccountSvc: Update balances
  API-->>UI: Transfer status & updated balance
  UI-->>Parent: Show transfer result
  Note right of API: Audit log: fund transfer

  == Set Spending Limit ==
  Parent->>UI: Set new spending limit
  UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit (OAuth2, RBAC)
  API->>DB: Update spending limit
  DB-->>API: Confirm update
  API-->>UI: Limit update status
  UI-->>Parent: Show confirmation
  Note right of API: Audit log: limit change

  == Transaction History ==
  Parent->>UI: View transactions
  UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions (OAuth2, RBAC)
  API->>TxnSvc: Fetch transactions
  TxnSvc-->>API: Transaction list
  API-->>UI: Paginated results
  UI-->>Parent: Display transactions
  Note right of API: Audit log: transaction history access